<title>CROATIA: Croatia details Jan-Dec '96 balance of payments.</title>
<headline>Croatia details Jan-Dec '96 balance of payments.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following balance of payments details.</p>
<p>					  JAN-DEC '96    JAN-DEC '95</p>
<p> CURRENT ACCOUNT (million USD)	 -1,452.3	 -1,712.0</p>
<p> CAPITAL AND FINANCIAL ACCOUNT	630.0	    411.5</p>
<p> -Direct investment		     348.9	     80.5</p>
<p> NET ERRORS AND OMISSIONS	     822.2	  1,300.5</p>
<p>NOTES -- Figures are cumulative and they include only preliminary data for the second half of the year. -- Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
</text>
